{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-team-contact-tempalte-js","path":"/team/abdul-rahman-alhamwi/contact/","result":{"data":{"strapiTeam":{"services":null,"locations":null,"strapi_id":227,"id":"8194379f-ee71-5d0a-8697-4d69f3c40ea2","rank":5,"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Abdul_Rahman_43cbc4499d_188fee346b.jpg"},"slug":"abdul-rahman-alhamwi","publish":true,"phone":"+971 568 308 221","office_phone":"+971 568 308 221","name":"Abdul Rahman Alhamwi","experience_since":null,"license":null,"email":"zoyaventure15@gmail.com","designation":"Director - Human Resources","extra":null,"about":{"data":{"about":"<p>Abdul Rahman Alhamwi is the Director of Human Resources at Zoya Ventures Real Estate, having joined the company in 2024. With 20 years of experience in HR and a strong background in Dubai’s real estate sector, he excels in managing people, processes, and organizational development within one of the region’s most competitive industries.</p><p>As Director of Human Resources, he plays a pivotal role in aligning people practices with the company’s long-term vision. His focus on building a positive workplace culture, developing future leaders, and fostering collaboration has helped create an environment where employees feel empowered to thrive.</p><p>He also holds globally recognized certifications, including SHRM, CIPD Level 3, and HR Analytics, and is currently working on implementing best-practice applications of AI in HR—advancing the future of human resources by leveraging technology and data to create impactful people strategies.</p><p>Abdul Rahman’s deep understanding of the local market, combined with his expertise in human capital management, enables him to lead innovative HR initiatives that strengthen the company’s position in the industry. His leadership ensures that Zoya Ventures Real Estate not only attracts top talent but also retains and nurtures it for sustainable growth.</p>"}},"sale_summary":null,"cate